Subject: [PATCH] DeepSeek V4.1: test the Torch vision selector and image runner

Base: patches 0001 through 0003 in this local experiment, over the imported
Christopher Owen 1107 stack and Local Inference Lab vLLM
19f2c20ed4d64ae22bd009ceacadd85e2a81e354.

Scope: add CPU unit coverage for the default TileLang selector, the explicit
Torch selector, invalid backend rejection, data-parallel factory enforcement,
the TensorFold compatibility constructor flag, and per-image patch slicing.
This patch changes tests only; it does not alter the serving implementation.

Provenance: the tests are newly implemented local AI-assisted validation for
the adapted selector/runner in patch 0002.  They contain no TensorFold code,
model data, deployment path, host address, or diagnostic span override.

Local experiment only; not represented as upstream-ready or PR-ready.
---
 tests/models/test_deepseek_v4_vision.py | 119 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 118 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

